  "notes": [
    "Options: deleteFiles is the modal's local state (useState(false), line 42); addImportListExclusion is read from the persisted seriesOptionsStore (line 40). Both are passed as query params to DELETE /series/{id}.",
    "Server side the two options are only carried on SeriesDeletedEvent; their effect happens in the event handlers (links). File deletion: 'if (message.DeleteFiles)' in MediaFileDeletionService.HandleAsync; exclusion: 'if (!message.AddImportListExclusion) { return; }' in ImportListExclusionService.HandleAsync, which inserts ImportListExclusion rows (table ImportListExclusions) via _repo.InsertMany.",
    "Health checks RemovedSeriesCheck, ImportListRootFolderCheck and RootFolderCheck also run on SeriesDeletedEvent via [CheckOn(typeof(SeriesDeletedEvent))]; not listed as links.",
    "Controller returns TypedResults.NoContent() (204) on success. Frontend onSuccess removes the series from the ['/series'] query cache; the modal is closed by onModalClose() in the same handler (no screen change in this file).",
    "SeriesRepository.Get(seriesIds) failure modes (missing ids) not followed.",
